OL,3,GNEWSAFlights delayed by 'technical
OL,4,Aissue' with air traffic control across
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FA "technical issue" with air traffic
OL,8,Fcontrol is causing delays to flights
OL,9,Facross Scotland.
OL,11,FThe national air traffic service (Nats)
OL,12,Fsaid engineers had been called in to
OL,13,Fdeal with the issue at the Prestwick
OL,14,FCentre which handles air traffic
OL,15,Fcontrol across Scotland and the north
OL,16,Fof England.
OL,18,FThe service said the issue was not
OL,19,Frelated to a software defect that led
OL,20,Fto the cancellation of 2,000 flights
OL,21,Facross the UK earlier this month.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
