OL,3,GNEWSAFlights delayed by 'technical
OL,4,Aissue' with air traffic control across
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FPassengers have taken to social media
OL,8,Fto confirm they are experiencing delays
OL,9,Fat Glasgow, Prestwick and Edinburgh
OL,10,Fairports. Dundee and Benbecula airports
OL,11,Fhave also confirmed flights are
OL,12,Fimpacted.
